","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"4:92"},{"pos":50,"ar":"يَجِدْ","en_gloss":"find","transliteration":"yajid","verse_key":"4:92"},{"pos":51,"ar":"فَصِيَامُ","en_gloss":"then fasting","transliteration":"faṣiyāmu","verse_key":"4:92"},{"pos":52,"ar":"شَهْرَيْنِ","en_gloss":"(for) two months","transliteration":"shahrayni","verse_key":"4:92"},{"pos":53,"ar":"مُتَتَابِعَيْنِ","en_gloss":"consecutively","transliteration":"mutatābiʿayni","verse_key":"4:92"},{"pos":54,"ar":"تَوْبَةًۭ","en_gloss":"(seeking) repentance","transliteration":"tawbatan","verse_key":"4:92"},{"pos":55,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"4:92"},{"pos":56,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۗ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"4:92"},{"pos":57,"ar":"وَكَانَ","en_gloss":"and is","transliteration":"wakāna","verse_key":"4:92"},{"pos":58,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"4:92"},{"pos":59,"ar":"عَلِيمًا","en_gloss":"All-Knowing","transliteration":"ʿalīman","verse_key":"4:92"},{"pos":60,"ar":"حَكِيمًۭا","en_gloss":"All-Wise","transliteration":"ḥakīman","verse_key":"4:92"},{"pos":61,"ar":"٩٢","en_gloss":"(92)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:92"}]},{"verse_key":"4:93","surah":4,"ayah":93,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَن يَقْتُلْ مُؤْمِنًا مُّتَعَمِّدًا فَجَزَآؤُهُۥ جَهَنَّمُ خَـٰلِدًا فِيهَا وَغَضِبَ ٱللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَلَعَنَهُۥ وَأَعَدَّ لَهُۥ عَذَابًا عَظِيمًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If anyone kills a believer deliberately, the punishment for him is Hell, and there he will remain: God is angry with him, and rejects him, and has prepared a tremendous torment for him.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"4:93"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَقْتُلْ","en_gloss":"kills","transliteration":"yaqtul","verse_key":"4:93"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مُؤْمِنًۭا","en_gloss":"a believer","transliteration":"mu'minan","verse_key":"4:93"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مُّتَعَمِّدًۭا","en_gloss":"intentionally","transliteration":"mutaʿammidan","verse_key":"4:93"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَجَزَآؤُهُۥ","en_gloss":"then his recompense","transliteration":"fajazāuhu","verse_key":"4:93"},{"pos":6,"ar":"جَهَنَّمُ","en_gloss":"(is) Hell","transliteration":"jahannamu","verse_key":"4:93"},{"pos":7,"ar":"خَـٰلِدًۭا","en_gloss":"abiding forever","transliteration":"khālidan","verse_key":"4:93"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"4:93"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَغَضِبَ","en_gloss":"and will fall the wrath","transliteration":"waghaḍiba","verse_key":"4:93"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"4:93"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"on him","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"4:93"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَلَعَنَهُۥ","en_gloss":"and He (will) curse him","transliteration":"walaʿanahu","verse_key":"4:93"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَأَعَدَّ","en_gloss":"and He has prepared","transliteration":"wa-aʿadda","verse_key":"4:93"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"for him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"4:93"},{"pos":15,"ar":"عَذَابًا","en_gloss":"a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhāban","verse_key":"4:93"},{"pos":16,"ar":"عَظِيمًۭا","en_gloss":"great","transliteration":"ʿaẓīman","verse_key":"4:93"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٩٣","en_gloss":"(93)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:93"}]},{"verse_key":"4:94","surah":4,"ayah":94,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوٓا۟ إِذَا ضَرَبْتُمْ فِى سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ فَتَبَيَّنُوا۟ وَلَا تَقُولُوا۟ لِمَنْ أَلْقَىٰٓ إِلَيْكُمُ ٱلسَّلَـٰمَ لَسْتَ مُؤْمِنًا تَبْتَغُونَ عَرَضَ ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا فَعِندَ ٱللَّهِ مَغَانِمُ كَثِيرَةٌ ۚ كَذَٰلِكَ كُنتُم مِّن قَبْلُ فَمَنَّ ٱللَّهُ عَلَيْكُمْ فَتَبَيَّنُوٓا۟ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ كَانَ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ خَبِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So, you who believe, be careful when you go to fight in God’s way, and do not say to someone who offers you a greeting of peace, ‘You are not a believer,’ out of desire for the chance gains of this life- God has plenty of gains for you. You yourself were in the same position [once], but God was gracious to you, so be careful: God is fully aware of what you do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"believe[d]","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"When","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ضَرَبْتُمْ","en_gloss":"you go forth","transliteration":"ḍarabtum","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":7,"ar":"سَبِيلِ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"sabīli","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَتَبَيَّنُوا۟","en_gloss":"then investigate","transliteration":"fatabayyanū","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تَقُولُوا۟","en_gloss":"say","transliteration":"taqūlū","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لِمَنْ","en_gloss":"to (the one) who","transliteration":"liman","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَلْقَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"offers","transliteration":"alqā","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِلَيْكُمُ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilaykumu","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلسَّلَـٰمَ","en_gloss":"(a greeting of) peace","transliteration":"l-salāma","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لَسْتَ","en_gloss":"You are not","transliteration":"lasta","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":17,"ar":"مُؤْمِنًۭا","en_gloss":"a believer","transliteration":"mu'minan","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":18,"ar":"تَبْتَغُونَ","en_gloss":"seeking","transliteration":"tabtaghūna","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":19,"ar":"عَرَضَ","en_gloss":"transitory gains","transliteration":"ʿaraḍa","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":20,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","en_gloss":"(of) the life","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":21,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","en_gloss":"(of) the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":22,"ar":"فَعِندَ","en_gloss":"for with","transliteration":"faʿinda","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":23,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":24,"ar":"مَغَانِمُ","en_gloss":"(are) booties","transliteration":"maghānimu","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":25,"ar":"كَثِيرَةٌۭ ۚ","en_gloss":"abundant","transliteration":"kathīratun","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":26,"ar":"كَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"Like that","transliteration":"kadhālika","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":27,"ar":"كُنتُم","en_gloss":"you were","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":28,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":29,"ar":"قَبْلُ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"qablu","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":30,"ar":"فَمَنَّ","en_gloss":"then conferred favor","transliteration":"famanna","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":31,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":32,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"upon you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":33,"ar":"فَتَبَيَّنُوٓا۟ ۚ","en_gloss":"so investigate","transliteration":"fatabayyanū","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":34,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":35,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":36,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":37,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":38,"ar":"تَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"you do","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":39,"ar":"خَبِيرًۭا","en_gloss":"All-Aware","transliteration":"khabīran","verse_key":"4:94"},{"pos":40,"ar":"٩٤","en_gloss":"(94)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4